268 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Data gives us confidence\056 Frameworks give us structure\056 But\240real strategy often requires action before the data is conclusive\056 We argue that most tools\054 even AI\054 tend to reinforce the executive preference for\240certainty\056 What\031s missing is an intelligent prompt toward\240courage\056\n\nThis is not about being reckless\056 It\031s about\240recognizing \030when\031 the pursuit of more validation is simply masking a reluctance to commit and then designing tools that help break that loop\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 269 0 R
     /Pg 260 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

